<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title><![CDATA[Spring]]></title><description><![CDATA[Level up your Java code and explore what Spring can do for you.]]></description><link>https://spring.io</link><generator>GatsbyJS</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 16 Dec 2025 04:33:31 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title><![CDATA[Spring for Apache Pulsar 1.2.13 and 2.0.1 are now available]]></title><link>https://spring.io/blog/2025/12/15/spring-for-apache-pulsar-1-2-13-and-2-0-1-are-now-available</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://spring.io/blog/2025/12/15/spring-for-apache-pulsar-1-2-13-and-2-0-1-are-now-available</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[onobc]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;On behalf of the team and everyone who has contributed, I’m happy to announce that Spring for Apache Pulsar &lt;code&gt;1.2.13&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;2.0.1&lt;/code&gt; have been released and are now available from Maven Central.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;1.2.13&lt;/code&gt; release will be included in the upcoming Spring Boot &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/milestones/3.4.13&quot;&gt;3.4.13&lt;/a&gt; and  &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/milestones/3.5.9&quot;&gt;3.5.9&lt;/a&gt; releases.
The &lt;code&gt;2.0.1&lt;/code&gt; release will be included in the upcoming Spring Boot &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/milestones/4.0.1&quot;&gt;4.0.1&lt;/a&gt; release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see the release notes (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-pulsar/releases/tag/v1.2.13&quot;&gt;1.2.13&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-pulsar/releases/tag/v2.0.1&quot;&gt;2.0.1&lt;/a&gt;) for more details.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Spring Cloud 2024.0.3 (aka Northfields) Has Been Released]]></title><link>https://spring.io/blog/2025/12/12/spring-cloud-2024-0-3-aka-northfields-has-been-released</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://spring.io/blog/2025/12/12/spring-cloud-2024-0-3-aka-northfields-has-been-released</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[ryanjbaxter]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 12 Dec 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;On behalf of the community, I am pleased to announce that the General Availability (RELEASE) of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.spring.io&quot;&gt;Spring Cloud 2024.0.3&lt;/a&gt; Release Train is available today. The release can be found in &lt;a href=&quot;https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/springframework/cloud/spring-cloud-dependencies/2024.0.3/&quot;&gt;Maven Central&lt;/a&gt;. You can check out the 2024.0.3 &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-release/wiki/Spring-Cloud-2024.0.3-Release-Notes&quot;&gt;release notes for more information&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;notable-changes-in-the-202403-release-train&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#notable-changes-in-the-202403-release-train&quot; aria-label=&quot;notable changes in the 202403 release train permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Notable Changes in the 2024.0.3 Release Train&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release uses Spring Boot 3.4.12.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A complete list of issues resolved in this release can be found in the GitHub project &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/orgs/spring-cloud/projects/179&quot;&gt;2024.0.3&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is the final open source release of the Spring Cloud 2024.0.x release train.  Open source support &lt;a href=&quot;https://spring.io/projects/spring-cloud#support&quot;&gt;ends at
the end of December 2025&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;spring-cloud-openfeign&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#spring-cloud-openfeign&quot; aria-label=&quot;spring cloud openfeign permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Spring Cloud Openfeign&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set max requests based on http client properties (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-openfeign/pull/1286&quot;&gt;#1286&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;spring-cloud-kubernetes&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#spring-cloud-kubernetes&quot; aria-label=&quot;spring cloud kubernetes permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Spring Cloud Kubernetes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loadbalancer with SERVICE mode cannot discover newly created services (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-kubernetes/issues/1970&quot;&gt;#1970&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cannot disable leaderElection for /info endpoint (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-kubernetes/issues/2085&quot;&gt;#2085&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;spring-cloud-function&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#spring-cloud-function&quot; aria-label=&quot;spring cloud function permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Spring Cloud Function&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preserve AWS X-Ray Context In Spring Cloud Function Custom Runtime (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-function/issues/1306&quot;&gt;#1306&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;spring-cloud-gateway&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#spring-cloud-gateway&quot; aria-label=&quot;spring cloud gateway permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Spring Cloud Gateway&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GatewayTagsProvider not working as documented (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-gateway/issues/4007&quot;&gt;#4007&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FormFilter Issue: Incorrect Handling of URL-Encoded Parameters in Query String (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-gateway/issues/3929&quot;&gt;#3929&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;spring-cloud-config&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#spring-cloud-config&quot; aria-label=&quot;spring cloud config permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Spring Cloud Config&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RefNotFoundException thrown when using &lt;code&gt;spring.cloud.config.send-all-labels=true&lt;/code&gt; with invalid commit ID (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spring-cloud/spring-cloud-config/issues/3126&quot;&gt;#3126&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
